      "description": "<p>You may use an action to perform <strong>Reload: </strong>Performs an 【<strong>Inventory</strong>】 action and spend <strong>6 Inventory Points </strong>to gains <strong>6 Revolver Bullets</strong> with <strong>different type of your choosing</strong>, ordered from first to last.</p><p>When you perform <strong>Reload </strong>while already having <strong>Revolver Bullets</strong>, all previous bullets are <strong>discarded</strong>.</p><p>Each time you perform an 【<strong>Attack</strong>】, you may spend the <strong>first bullet</strong> in the bullet order to apply <strong>Bullet Effect </strong>to the attack.</p><p>When you first acquire this skill, you may select <strong>6 types of Revolver Bullets </strong>from Facets list<strong>. </strong>Whenever you acquire this skill again, you may select <strong>one more type of bullets</strong>.</p><p></p>",
